software newly written for the site, including drawings written as inline SVG code in src/ components).
Learning materials and examples (content/, examples/), image files (public/images/) and documentation are
licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (see LICENSE-CONTENT.md). Third-party materials
and open-source libraries listed individually in sources.yaml are excluded and remain under their original
terms.
